  "description": "DUBLIV is proud to present The Residence at College Square, a brand-new collection of premium one and two bedroom apartments located in the heart of Dublin 2, adjacent to Trinity College Dublin.\r\n\r\nThis high-end development of 57 luxury homes offers a rare opportunity to live in a refined, design-led setting within walking distance of Grafton Street, Merrion Square, and the Docklands. Every element of The Residence has been carefully considered to deliver a five-star living experience combining style, comfort, and convenience in equal measure.\r\n\r\nRising from the 11th to the 20th floor, these exceptional luxury apartments offer a rare vantage point over Dublin 2, with sweeping views that take in the River Liffey, Trinity College, and the dynamic cityscape beyond. Designed for those who appreciate refined living in the heart of the capital, each apartment combines elevated tranquillity with front-row access to Dublin’s most iconic landmarks.\r\n\r\nUnrivalled Amenities:\r\n\r\n•\tElegant eleventh-floor rooftop garden and residents’ lounge, offering panoramic views across the city\r\n•\tContemporary on-site gym, exclusively for residents\r\n•\tFull-time concierge service\r\n•\tSecure underground parking (available at additional cost)\r\n•\tPet-friendly \r\n•\tHigh-speed communal WiFi in the resident lounge for work or relaxation\r\n•\tCommunity events \r\n•\tSecure bicycle storage and lift access throughout\r\n\r\nApartment Features:\r\n\r\n•\tBespoke interiors with luxury finishes throughout\r\n•\tSpacious open-plan layouts filled with natural light\r\n•\tDesigner kitchens with integrated appliances\r\n•\tElegant bathrooms with premium fixtures\r\n•\tGenerous storage solutions in every home\r\n\r\nWhether you’re spending the day in the city centre for work or soaking up the vibrant culture, dining, and green spaces that Dublin city  has to offer, The Residence at College Square puts you right at the centre of it all.\r\n\r\nTo arrange a private viewing or to register your interest, please contact DUBLIV today.\r\n\r\nhttps://theresidencecollegesquare.ie/",
